  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>Smart Helmet Ecosystem</h2>
    <p>
      The HMD is designed as the anchor for a broader modular accessory system: swappable lens
      modules (clear, tinted, night vision), a voice-activated AI assistant, and an expansion rail
      for add-ons like action cameras or communication modules.
    </p>

