  <section class="story-section">
    <h2>Current Status</h2>
    <p>
      The CAD design is complete and the first prototype has been printed. Currently working on
      calibrating the Kalman filter parameters and optimizing the segmentation model to run at
      30+ FPS on mid-range smartphones.
    </p>
